      "v": 8,
      "zh": "大卫又从属哈大利谢的提巴（或译：比他）和均二城中夺取了许多的铜。后来所罗门用此制造铜海、铜柱，和一切的铜器。",
      "en": "From Tibhath[NOTE:1] and Kun,[NOTE:2] Hadadezer’s cities, David took a great deal of bronze. (Solomon used it to make the big bronze basin called “The Sea,”[NOTE:3] the pillars, and other bronze items.)",
